2.1.evidence:
a. establishing a prevention and handling network for Violence in a coordinated, integrated, and synchronized manner based on a partnership pattern;
(1) The Implementation of Protection of Victims of Gender-Based Violence and Children shall be carried out by a non-structural institution under the coordination of the SKPD responsible for women's empowerment and Child Protection.
(2) The non-structural institution as referred to in paragraph (1) shall consist of elements of the Regional Government, elements of vertical agencies in the field of law enforcement, elements of the community, and elements of related stakeholders.
